# Testes e migrations

Base: [PHPUnit 10](https://docs.phpunit.de/en/10.5/), [Phinx](https://book.cakephp.org/phinx/0/en/index.html).

## PHPUnit

- Suítes: `tests/Unit`, `tests/Feature` (`phpunit.xml`)
- Preferir testes **sem** banco e sem `.env` (como o README descreve)
- Namespace: `Tests\` → `tests/`

```bash
docker compose -f compose.yaml -f compose.dev.yaml run --rm server ./vendor/bin/phpunit
docker build --target test .
```

## Phinx

- Migrations PHP em `database/migrations/`
- Seeds: SQL em `database/seeds/`; admin em `database/seed_admin.php`
- Ambientes: `development` / `production` em `phinx.php` (mesmas env vars do app)

```bash
docker compose -f compose.yaml -f compose.dev.yaml exec server vendor/bin/phinx migrate -e development
docker compose -f compose.yaml -f compose.dev.yaml exec -T db \
  psql -U postgres -d template_admin < database/seeds/001_roles_permissions_admin.sql
docker compose -f compose.yaml -f compose.dev.yaml exec server php database/seed_admin.php
```

- Não versionar dumps com senhas; seeds de demo (`admin@example.com`) só para bootstrap documentado
